<title>JAPAN: Tokuyo City falls sharply in afternoon.</title>
<headline>Tokuyo City falls sharply in afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokuyo City Bank Ltd fell sharply in early Tuesday afternoon trade, extending morning losses.</p>
<p>The share was down 50 yen at 169 at 0352 GMT.</p>
<p>It headed the list of top percentage losers on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange in the early afternoon.</p>
<p>Turnover was more than 1.94 million shares.</p>
</text>
